  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ef4120e8d7cc4784ba80e7aeb2d6d58d, type: 3}
  m_Name: Bragi_About_Sigyn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Repeatable: 0
  Lines:
  - Text: I remember a second voice, the one who told me to kill the ravens and free
      my father. Was that my mother?
    Speaker: 1
  - Text: Hm, a difficult question. She had the largest hand in your creation and
      considered her husband, Loki, your father. That feels like claiming motherhood
      for you, but just as much she may not claim that same title. You will have
      to speak with her about it.
    Speaker: 2
  - Text: Can you tell me who she is?
    Speaker: 1
  - Text: Ah, the beautiful and nurturing Sigyn, brave healer and protector of all.
      She took care of Loki after he was punished for another one of his pranks and
      fell in love with him. Ever since his capture following the death of Baldur,
      she has been his watchful guardian.
    Speaker: 2
  - Text: She sounds incredible.
    Speaker: 1
  - Text: That she is, little Lie. Among the best of us, I dare say.
    Speaker: 2
  - Text: So I am on a quest to not only free my father, but free my mother from
      having to see him suffer. I curse the all-father for his tyranny!
    Speaker: 0
